      "text": [
        " سَأَلْتُهُ عَنِ الصَّبِيِّ مَتَى يَصُومُ قَالَ إِذَا قَوِيَ عَلَى الصِّيَامِ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Usman Bin Isa, from Sama’at who said, ",
          "‘I asked him<sup>asws</sup> about the child, when can he Fast?’ He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘When he is strong upon the Fasting’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "3. Ahmad ibn Muhammad from has narrated from ‘Uthman ibn ‘Isa from Sama‘ah, who has said the following: “I once asked abu ‘Abd Allah, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, about a child when he is required to fast. He (the Imam) said, ‘When he is able to fast he must fast.’” "
        ]
      }
